    <profile name="Dodge (1)" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="852c-9cc6-1d2b-140a">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">Enemy models repeat their successful rolls to hit of the lowest (1) successful value. This means, if an enemy would impact at (3+), all 3 dice rolls in the dice must be repeated.


This works against Stomp Attacks and Impact Hits, but does not work when the enemy has the Strike First special rule, or if the unit has been charged from its flank or rear (if the unit is in Skirmisher formation, it has no front, flank or rear).</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Wolfboyz&apos; Giant Wolf" typeId="b070-143a-73f-2772" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="f44d-f532-4810-9c00" page="Dogs of War Army List, Warhammer Fantasy 5th Edition, Adapted for ToW">
