    <profile name="Cold Blooded (Regenegade), (Mercenaries)" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="3754-8cbd-6c71-fa5e">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">When required to make a Leadership or Break Test, models with this special rule may roll an extra D6 and discard the highest result.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Blessed by The Old Ones" typeId="c1ac-c1c8-f9d5-9673" typeName="Special Rule" hidden="false" id="ff73-f41e-e1b1-31a7">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9f84-4221-785a-db50">Tichi-Huichi and his Skink Cold One Riders enjoy the special favor of the Old Ones. 

They belong to a portentous spawning, brought forth for a mission devised untold millenia ago, and consequently a mysterious aura of protection pervades the regiment. 

A strange, tropical fatigue descends on the foe, securing Tichi-Huichi&apos;s chance to get away and live to fight another day.

To represent this, hand-to-hand opponents will never pursue Tichi-Huichi&apos;s Raiders if they beat them in combat, although they can try to reform as usual.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hengus The Druid" typeId="b070-143a-73f-2772" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="18c9-1715-a417-aa8e">
